5,1,1,talk,Minato,,"Hello everyone. I am very happy to be here with you. I want to learn how we pick the best project, so I will look into the staffing of the coordination group and the in-house developer availability.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,"It is a pleasure to meet you all. To ensure we are grounded in reality, I would like to examine the network coverage at customer plants and the outcomes of the last three internal rollouts.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,George,,"It is a pleasure to be with you all. To ensure we are not blindsided by future costs, I shall examine the capital budget and software allowance, as well as vendor licence pricing versus fixed-fee work.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,May,,"Hi everyone! I'm so excited to be part of this. To make sure we aren't just repeating old mistakes, I'll look into the outcomes of the last three internal rollouts and the record of cross-unit standardization efforts!","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Midori,,"Thank you, everyone. I am very happy to be here with you all. To understand the daily challenges our teams face, I would like to look into the misrouted deliveries in the incident logs and the time lost to copying existing records.","{""words"":42,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Minato,,It is very interesting to see what everyone is looking for. I think we are all being very thorough. I am looking forward to hearing what you all discover!,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,"I agree, Minato. A thorough investigation is the only way to find a path that is truly sustainable. I wish you all a peaceful and productive search for the truth.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,George,,I agree. It is better to be cautious now than to face surprises later. I believe our combined findings will provide the clarity we need to make a responsible decision.,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,May,,You guys are so serious! Let's keep it light while we dig through the archives. I have a feeling we're going to find some juicy details that'll make our decision way easier. Can't wait!,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Midori,,"I agree, May! It is wonderful to have such a positive energy here. I hope the information we find helps us support the people on the floor and make a truly helpful choice.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Minato,,I agree with Midori. It would be very nice if we could find a project that makes everyone's day a little easier. I hope we can all be kind to each other while we decide.,"{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,"Kindness is a virtue that makes any collaboration more fruitful. I believe that if we approach our findings with an open heart and a calm mind, the right choice will reveal itself.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,George,,"I agree. While a calm mind is essential, we must also maintain a steady eye on the practicalities. I look forward to seeing if the numbers align with our ambitions.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,May,,"@George, you're such a realist! But a little bit of intuition goes a long way, doesn't it? I'm sure the numbers will behave themselves if we're charming enough. Let's see what the records have to say!","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Midori,,"@May, you always have such a wonderful way of looking at things! I think a mix of intuition and data is a lovely balance. I'm looking forward to seeing what we all find.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Minato,,I think we have a very good plan. I am ready to see what the records tell us now. I hope everyone has a wonderful time discovering new things!,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
21,1,4,pass,Minato,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
22,1,4,talk,Jonathan,,I concur. Let us move forward in silence and reflection. I look forward to our next meeting and the insights we shall share.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
23,1,4,pass,Jonathan,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
24,1,4,talk,George,,I agree. We have a comprehensive set of inquiries. I shall now step back and examine the financial records to ensure we are standing on solid ground. I am ready.,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
25,1,4,pass,George,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
26,1,4,talk,May,,"I'm all set too! I'll go see if the past has any secrets to tell us. Good luck with your digging, everyone! See you in the next round!","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
27,1,4,pass,May,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
28,1,4,talk,Midori,,I am also ready. I hope the records show us where the real struggles are so we can find a project that truly helps our colleagues. I look forward to seeing you all soon!,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
