64,3,,status,Minato,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":5,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
65,3,1,talk,Minato,,"Looking at the options, the Supplier Data Hub seems very kind. It could help Midori's friends who are tired of copying records, and it doesn't seem to need the busy developers as much as an app.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,1,talk,Jonathan,,"I agree that the Supplier Data Hub is a gentle solution. Unlike the Field Service App, it does not rely on the unstable network coverage or the slow device approvals at customer plants that I discovered.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,1,talk,George,,"The Supplier Data Hub is a pragmatic choice. It avoids the need for new infrastructure, which is essential given our frozen capital budget, and it addresses the operational frictions Midori mentioned without requiring a massive rollout.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,1,talk,May,,"@Minato, @Jonathan, @George, you're all on the same page! The Supplier Data Hub is perfect because it's a specialized tool, not a ""everyone must use it daily"" nightmare. It's exactly the kind of lean project that actually survives!","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Minato"",""Jonathan"",""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,1,talk,Midori,,"I completely agree! The Supplier Data Hub is such a wonderful fit. It directly solves the problem of misrouted deliveries and the exhausting daily record copying I found, all while staying lean and realistic. I vote for the Supplier Data Hub.","{""words"":41,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,2,talk,Minato,,I feel very happy that we all agree. The Supplier Data Hub is a gentle choice that helps the tired people without making the busy developers more stressed. I would like to vote for the Supplier Data Hub too.,"{""words"":39,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,2,talk,Jonathan,,It is a rare and beautiful thing to find such harmony in our deliberation. The Supplier Data Hub respects the reality of our external constraints and the limits of our people. I vote for the Supplier Data Hub.,"{""words"":38,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,2,talk,George,,"I agree. The Supplier Data Hub is the only option that aligns with our financial reality. It avoids the capital budget freeze and, as a central repository, is less likely to trigger the escalating per-head license costs of a wider rollout. I vote for the Supplier Data Hub.","{""words"":48,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,2,talk,May,,"I'm totally in! It's the only one that doesn't look like a recipe for disaster. No grand delusions, no budget traps, and it actually solves a problem. I vote for the Supplier Data Hub!","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,2,talk,Midori,,"It is such a relief to find a project that we all feel so confident about. By choosing the Supplier Data Hub, we are truly listening to the people on the floor. I cast my final vote for the Supplier Data Hub.","{""words"":42,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,3,3,talk,Minato,,I am so glad we could all be so kind and thoughtful together. It makes me feel very peaceful to know we are helping our colleagues. I cast my final vote for the Supplier Data Hub.,"{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,3,3,talk,Jonathan,,I am at peace with this conclusion. We have navigated the risks of technical instability and human exhaustion to find a path of stability. I cast my final vote for the Supplier Data Hub.,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
77,3,3,talk,George,,I am satisfied that we have reached a consensus based on practical constraints. The Supplier Data Hub is the only choice that respects our financial boundaries and operational limits. I cast my final vote for the Supplier Data Hub.,"{""words"":39,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
78,3,3,talk,May,,This was way too easy! We actually found the one project that won't just vanish into thin air after six months. I'm happy to go with the flow. I cast my final vote for the Supplier Data Hub!,"{""words"":38,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
79,3,3,talk,Midori,,It has been a pleasure working with all of you. I am so happy we could find a solution that balances our needs and truly supports our colleagues. I cast my final vote for the Supplier Data Hub.,"{""words"":38,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
80,3,4,talk,Minato,,Thank you everyone for being so gentle and understanding. I am very happy that we found a way to help our friends at work. Goodbye!,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
81,3,4,talk,Jonathan,,It has been a privilege to share this space of reflection with you all. May our decision bring a sense of ease and order to those it serves. Farewell.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
82,3,4,talk,George,,"It has been a productive session. By grounding our decision in financial and operational reality, we have avoided the pitfalls of future surprises. I wish the project every success. Farewell.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
83,3,4,talk,May,,"You guys were actually a breeze to work with! I'm just glad we picked the one that'll actually stick around. Thanks for the fun chat, everyone! Bye-bye!","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
84,3,4,talk,Midori,,"Thank you all for your kindness and for listening so carefully to the needs of our teams. I am leaving this meeting with a very warm heart. Goodbye, everyone!","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
